<Text>&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;QPSK Transceiver with symbol timing recovery&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;This example workspace demonstrates&amp;nbsp;a QPSK&amp;nbsp;transmitter and&amp;nbsp;receiver system built entirely from parts that are supported by C++ code generation in the&amp;nbsp;Algorithm Design library. This makes it possible to generate C++ code for the entire system.&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;This QPSK&amp;nbsp;transmitter/receiver system consists of:&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;a)&amp;nbsp; Bit_Source&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;It can generate&amp;nbsp;pseudo-random bit sequence. The bit sequence is obtained by performing an XOR operation between a PN15_Bits and a PN9_Bits sequences. Both&amp;nbsp;PN15_Bits and PN_9Bits are generated using an LFSR (Linear Feedback Shift Register). Their&amp;nbsp;primitive ploynomials are:&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TABLE style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt&quot; class=MsoTableGrid border=1 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TBODY&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;PN15_Bits&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x)=x^15 + x + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 1; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN9_Bits&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x)=x^9 + x^4 + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&lt;/TBODY&gt;&lt;/TABLE&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;b) Tx&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;It is a QPSK modulator. After QPSK mapping, the signal&amp;nbsp;is upsampled by 4&amp;nbsp;and goes through a square root raise cosine &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;filter with a roll-off factor 0.5.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;c) PN_AWGN&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;It is an approximation of an&amp;nbsp;AWGN noise generator. According to the law of large number, eight pseudo-random integer generators &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;are added together to approximate AWGN noise.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;The eight pseudo-random integer generators are all implemented using LFSRs (a&amp;nbsp;SerToPara part is used to convert 8 bits to an integer).&amp;nbsp;The &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;primitive polynomials for the LFSRs are:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &#x00E5;&#x00AE;&#x008B;&#x00E4;&#x00BD;&#x0093;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&quot; lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TABLE style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt&quot; class=MsoTableGrid border=1 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TBODY&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN9&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x) = x^9 + x^4 + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 1&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN10&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x) = x^10 + x^3 + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 2&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN11&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x) = x^11 + x^2 + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 3&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN12&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x) = x^12 + x^6 + x^4 + x + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 4&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN13&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x) = x^13 + x^4 + x^3 + x + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 5&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN14&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x) = x^14 + x^10 + x^6 + x + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 6&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN15&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;p(x) = x^15 + x + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TR style=&quot;mso-yfti-irow: 7; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 2.7in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1&quot; width=259&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; class=MsoNormal align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun&quot;&gt;PN16&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;TD style=&quot;BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #ece9d8; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; WIDTH: 3.95in; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #ece9d8; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 0in; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-themecolor: text1; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-themecolor: text1; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-top-themecolor: text1; mso-border-bottom-themecolor: text1; mso-border-right-themecolor: text1&quot; width=379&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-FAMILY: &apos;Calibri&apos;,&apos;sans-serif&apos;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi&quot;&gt;p(x) = x^16 + x^12 + x^3 + x + 1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/TD&gt;&lt;/TR&gt;&lt;/TBODY&gt;&lt;/TABLE&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;In &quot;Design1 (Schematic)&quot; Equation tab, there is a variable SNR, which can be used to control the power of AWGN. Only positive values are valid for this variable.set.&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;d) Rx&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;It consist of a matched filter, symbol timing synchronization with Gardner algorithm, and QPSK demodulator. It uses a polyphase filter to get 16 samples per symbol and adjust the sampling position according to the detected result of the Gardner detector.&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;The Gardner detector&amp;nbsp;result is:&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;Er = YI(r-1/2) * [YI(r) - YI(r-1)] + YQ(r-1/2) * [YQ(r) -&amp;nbsp;YQ(r-1)]&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;where YI(r) is the sample in I path and YI(r-1/2) is the sample half symbol behind YI(r); YQ(r) is the sample in&amp;nbsp;Q path and YQ(r-1/2) is the sample half symbol behind YQ(r).&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;When Er is less than 0,&amp;nbsp;the current sampling position is leading the optimal sampling position; otherwise, when Er is larger than 0, the current sampling position is lagging the optimal sampling position.&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;The detected Er value&amp;nbsp;goes through a loop filter and is fed back to the polyphase filter to select the sampling position. In &quot;loop_filter&quot; model, the detected Er values&amp;nbsp;are accumulated. When the accumulated value is larger than the parameter &quot;loop_threshold&quot;&amp;nbsp;(specified in equation tab of &quot;loop_filter&quot; model), the sampling position is adjusted accordingly.&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;e) BER&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;This model is used to compare Tx and Rx bit streams. It outputs &quot;err_num&quot; and &quot;total_num&quot; to represent the numbers of error bits and total bits. Then BER ratio can be calculated. &lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
